======================   ========================================================
:attr:`ord`              matrix norm
======================   ========================================================
`'fro'` (default)        Frobenius norm
`'nuc'`                  nuclear norm
`inf`                    `max(sum(abs(x), dim=1))`
`-inf`                   `min(sum(abs(x), dim=1))`
`1`                      `max(sum(abs(x), dim=0))`
`-1`                     `min(sum(abs(x), dim=0))`
`2`                      largest singular value
`-2`                     smallest singular value
======================   ========================================================

